                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ganna Koreshini hayyu Ajemi tahe, AABBO Waaqi dubbi duri raaga Yeremiani jed'e guute. Inni herega kana Koreshitini d'ufe jennaani inni qonqo tana t'aafe, qonqo suni lafa inni Mohatu ch'ufati lalabani keesati soomani.",
          "type": "text",
