              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 44.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wonti hayyuuni Ajemi ka Koreshi jed'ani jed'u tana: AABBO Waaqi gubbaa, yayu gudda lafa ch'ufa na tolche, ammalle waan nani jed'e, lafa Yuda keesa, dira Yerusalemu; mana naa jaari: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqi isani nama gumi isaa ch'ufa woliini jiraatinna kaa, Yerusalemu d'aqa, Mana AABBO Waaqa Israeli ka qara ch'ach'abe jaara — Waaqi dira suni isuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo nami gumi isaa tokoleeni, ka duri boojiani, waan galuni d'abe, nami olla isaa ha isa qarqaare, qarsifi worqifi woreegaafi geejibaafi ammalle waan Mana Waaqaa ka Yerusalemu keesati Waaqaa baasani kennuufi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani jari balbala gosa Yudatifi ta Benjamini mata qaaloleefi worra Lawitifi nama ch'ufa ka Waaqi herega isaa qajeelcha woliini kaani, Mana Waaqa ka Yerusalemu jiru mid'aasani jaaru d'aqani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami olla worraa ch'ufti worra qarqaare, miha qarsiti, worqi, woreega, geejiba, waan dadansa d'ibifi waan Mana Waaqa keesati Waaqa baasanile kennanifi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koreshini miha Mana Waaqa, ka duri Nebukadrezani Yerusalemu boojie Mana Waaqa isaati galche, deebise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni miha kana Mithredathi, ka miha hayyu qorqoratuti kenne; innileeni hede, t'aafe, namicha gudda Yuda ka Sheshbaza jed'ani kenne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miha suni kana:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.9+EZR.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.9",
              "EZR.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
